[Options]


[A.]
<h2>~kBack to back</h2>
<i>"A bad ally is better than a good enemy"--unknown</i>
<p>You and your ally are fighting back to back. 
<p>You can do it but if not its just a game.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>A message from the rain prince's assistant.</h2>

<p>Oh no.  The good prince is now dead.  What shall we do?

$Button=Keep Fighting,DoNothing,0
$Button=Retreat,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Try Again,Tell,TryAgain


[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>I can't believe you have defeated me!</h2>

<p>I grant you the knowledge of the Ice cannon.

$Button=Do or die or don't and die,GetTechnology,129


[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>How did you beat me?</h2>

<p>You may now use my knowledge.

$Button=OK,GetTechnology,139


[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>The world is getting darker all around me.</h2>

<p>You may now use my knowledge to benifit your tribe.

$Button=Gee Thanks,GetTechnology,143


[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>My flames are extinguished.</h2>

<p>You may choose one of my technologies.

$Button=Cannon,GetTechnology,128
$Button=Balloon,GetTechnology,111
$Button=SunBarricade,GetTechnology,136


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations</h2>
<p>Hey I knew you could do it.
<P>I hope you can stay away from trouble from now on.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h2>Defeat</h2>
<p>Well it's no big deal just try again.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]




